small nimble orc scout~
an orc scout~
A short, nimble looking orc snarls at you before charging.
~
The orc before you is a vhati, a junior member in the great Dharzi army, whose
job it is to scout ahead and locate prey for the remainder of the hoarde. Its
blood-stained tusks jut out from its wart-covered snout, and it grins evilly
at you, glad to have achieved its mission.
~
